    "body": "I think the document creating step should be preceded by the Window creation.\r\n\r\nFor initial about:blank document case, we can move [create a new browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-a-new-browsing-context) step 4, 5 to before 2 and 6 to before 3 I think.\r\n\r\nFor the navigation case, the document is created before the Window object already, but we'd need to move the step that sets Window's associated Document into the step 3 and 4.",
