    "created_at": "2018-06-06T20:30:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-06T20:30:56Z",
    "body": "This seems really broken, but I'm not clear what the right fix is, because at least inside \"create a new browsing context\", we never have the appropriate URL on hand. Would we have to thread it through from all the callers?? Any hints from implementers here on a better architecture?",
