    "created_at": "2020-11-21T01:49:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-21T01:49:42Z",
    "body": "Would it suffice to under the definition of `Window`, define what happens when one is \"created\" (and \"created\" might take some parameters perhaps). Then that \"created\" bit would simply create the initial document with those aforementioned parameters? That seems like a relatively easy fix but I'm not sure if it is ignoring other things.",
