    "updated_at": "2020-12-02T19:19:32Z",
    "body": "Hmm, that isn't the fix I was envisioning for this. I was thinking we would just move the URL computation up, to earlier in \"create a new browsing context\", and pass that in to \"set up a window environment settings object\".\r\n\r\nActually, I think it's always about:blank for \"create a new browsing context\". So the problematic call site is [create and initialize a `Document` object](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#initialise-the-document-object). But again that's pretty simple; just pass the _creationURL_ variable in.",
